  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Engineer Broad Vision Progressive Self Help Group (EBV) Nyandarua County, Engineer Town Type of Project: Income Generating Activity - Milk Dispensers Project Description: Buy milk coolers to preserve the milk in the market. This will reduce wastage and increase farmers income. Grant Requested: $7,000 to buy two milk dispensers Project Manager: Priscilla Muthoni Community/Group Contribution: Space to run the project, transportation of the dispensers and installation costs, training of community members in milk handling and staff to work at the milk shop Beneficiaries: 48 male, 72 female, and 3,336 indirect orphans and vulnerable children (OVC) .</narrative>
  </description>
